Software Requirements

The following Python libraries are required to run this project successfully:

Gradio – used to build the interactive web interface

Requests – used for handling HTTP requests to external APIs

gTTS (Google Text-to-Speech) – used to convert text responses into speech

deep-translator – used for language translation between native languages and English

google-generativeai – used to integrate the Gemini AI model for generating responses

These dependencies are listed in the requirements.txt file and can be installed using the pip package manager.
